    "contract": "assurance_kernel/task_intent/v1",
    "task_id": "2026-08-18-003-foreground-canary-assurance-review-r2",
    "goal": "Cut Kernel deterministic QA and native Review from detached session jobs/follow-up retrieval to one foreground Tool pipeline plus one reserved foreground standard Agent receipt, while deleting the superseded interactive background continuation route and preserving every existing authority, freshness, single-terminal, unknown-settlement, cancellation, and literal-user authorization invariant. [succession from 2026-08-18-002-foreground-canary-assurance-review-r2]",
    "acceptance": [
      {
        "id": "acc-foreground-qa-settlement",
        "assertion": "imm_kernel_canary advance_assurance synchronously runs deterministic QA inside the foreground Tool call after fresh evidence: it captures the immutable snapshot, forwards the host AbortSignal through pre-verification and subprocess execution, applies exactly one QA approval/rework through revision CAS, emits bounded native progress/results, and returns one terminal state covering pass-to-review-ready, rework, cancellation, timeout, failure, or settlement_unknown. Cancellation before authority commit performs zero Kernel writes; cancellation after CAS cannot abandon settlement. Background QA jobs, heartbeats, timers, completion follow-ups, notify milestones, and cancel_assurance are deleted; host Escape/foreground Tool cancellation replaces command-owned cancel; Footer remains empty.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.3.14\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-assurance-progression.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-work-extension.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-assurance-advance.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-assurance-authority.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-assurance-observability.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-user-authority.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 300000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 262144\n}\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "acc-foreground-native-review-bridge",
        "assertion": "A session-local Review bridge owns one transient reservation per (task_id, operation_id, snapshot/bundle identity). Extension tool_call observation validates exact reserved foreground Agent arguments and native toolCallId; a matching tool_result supplies the result-content verdict and tool_execution_end only corroborates lifecycle without creating a second terminal. submit_review revalidates the fresh projection, parses the structured verdict, records a pending Review, and returns awaiting_user; request_authorization remains the sole literal-user confirmation that applies the verdict. Matching receipts are accepted exactly once; mismatched, duplicate, malformed, cancelled, provider-failed, stale, unreserved, crash-interrupted, or event-order-inverted results fail closed with zero writes; session shutdown garbage-collects transient reservations/receipts. Background spawn receipts, get_subagent_result, stop RPC, follow-up completion delivery, and late-notification deduplication are deleted. The extension-side package test copies remain byte-consistent with the same contract.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.3.14\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-work-extension.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-native-review.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-review-dispatch-resilience.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-assurance-progression.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-assurance-continuation.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-user-authority.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-notification-correlation.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/pi-canary-lifecycle-package.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 300000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 262144\n}\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "acc-assurance-authority-package-and-regression",
        "assertion": "The atomic cutover preserves TaskIntent, descriptor, enrollment receipt, TaskRecord, finding, approval, capability, and authorization schemas; immutable snapshot binding, review bundle provenance, descriptor concurrency/budgets, waiver taxonomy, final-lock freshness, atomic TaskRecord/workspace/backend-claim behavior, reviewer authority, and completion gates remain unchanged. Canonical roadmap, Pi assurance Specs, subagent dispatch protocol, README, USER_GUIDE, source skills, packaged dist docs, package boundary/consumer/loader assertions, active runtime docs contracts, and executable structural contracts consistently require foreground QA/Review and an empty Footer; no active interactive Canary path launches background work, sends required follow-up notifications, polls status/results, or retains command-owned cancel. The complete Bun repository regression passes. Manual Pi TUI assurance progress/cancel smoke is required before using this cutover for another production Enrollment.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.3.14\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 300000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 262144\n}\n"
      }
